    {
      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "To determine how many minutes it will take to print 200 pages given that the printer prints 17 pages per minute, we can use the following steps:\n\n1. **Determine the total print time in minutes:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{Total print time} = \\frac{\\text{Total pages to print}}{\\text{Pages printed per minute}}\n   \\]\n   Here, the total pages to print is 200 and the pages printed per minute is 17.\n\n2. **Calculate the number of minutes:**\n   \\[\n   \\text{Total print time} = \\frac{200 \\text{ pages}}{17 \\text{ pages/minute}}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Perform the division:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{200}{17} \\approx 11.76\n   \\]\n\n4. **Round the result to the nearest whole number:**\n   Since 11.76 is closer to 12 than to 11, we round it up to the nearest whole number.\n\n5. **Write the final answer:**\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{12}\n   \\]",
